  "translation": "Amatsjahu boaa Yehuda mmɔdɔm ma ɔgyee wɔn sii wɔn agyapadie fie so, mmɔdɔm apem soafoɔ ne ɔha soafoɔ nkyɛmu, Yehuda ne Binjamin nyinaa; ɔkan wɔn firi ɔbarima a wadi mfeɛ aduonu so kɔ soro, na ɔhunuu wɔn nnipa ɔha apem ha a wɔpaw wɔn, wɔkɔ ɔko mu, wɔfa kyerɛw ne ntɛmagye. Amatsjahu boaa Yehuda ⟨את⟩ na ɔsi wɔn wɔ fie awofoɔ so, mmɔdɔm apem soafoɔ ne ɔha soafoɔ, Yehuda ne Binjamin nyinaa; ɔkan wɔn firi ɔbarima a ɔwɔ mfeɛ aduonu na ɛboro so, na ɔhunuu wɔn dodoɔ mpem abiasa ɔha nnipa a wɔpaw wɔn a wɔtu kɔ ɔsa mu, wɔkura kyerɛw ne ntɛmagye wɔn nsa mu.",
